      en: ["Became the capital of Bali province in 1958, replacing Singaraja.", "The name Denpasar means 'North of the Market' in the Balinese language.", "The Bajra Sandhi Monument was completed in 2003 and sits in Renon Square.", "Puputan Square commemorates the 1906 mass suicide in defiance of Dutch rule.", "Pasar Badung is the largest traditional market on the island, operating 24/7.", "The Bali Arts Festival is held annually at the Art Center (Taman Werdhi Budaya).", "Pura Jagatnatha is the largest Hindu temple in the city center.", "The city's population grew rapidly from 80,000 in 1960 to over 700,000 today."],
      es: ["Capital de la provincia de Bali desde 1958.", "La plaza Puputan recuerda el suicidio ritual masivo de 1906.", "Alberga el Museo de Bali (Museum Negeri Propinsi Bali), fundado en 1931.", "El Pura Jagatnatha es el templo más importante del centro de la ciudad.", "Unos 900.000 habitantes viven en el área urbana directa.", "El 'Bali Arts Festival' se celebra aquí anualmente en junio/julio.", "Principal centro comercial para la artesanía balinesa."],
      pt: ["Capital da província de Bali desde 1958.", "A Praça Puputan recorda o suicídio ritual em massa de 1906.", "Abriga o Museu de Bali (Museum Negeri Propinsi Bali), fundado em 1931.", "O Pura Jagatnatha é o templo mais importante no centro da cidade.", "Cerca de 900.000 habitantes vivem na área urbana direta.", "O festival de arte 'Bali Arts Festival' realiza-se aqui anualmente em junho/julho.", "O centro comercial mais importante para o artesanato balinês."],
      fr: ["Capitale de la province de Bali depuis 1958.", "La place Puputan commémore le suicide rituel collectif de 1906.", "Accueille le musée de Bali (Museum Negeri Propinsi Bali), fondé en 1931.", "Le Pura Jagatnatha est le temple le plus important du centre-ville.", "Environ 900 000 habitants résident dans la zone urbaine directe.", "Le « Bali Arts Festival » s'y déroule chaque année en juin/juillet.", "Principal centre de négoce pour l'artisanat balinais."],
